<title>USA: ValuJet Airlines Dec load factor.</title>
<headline>ValuJet Airlines Dec load factor.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		  1995</p>
<p> Load factor - percent		  56.0		62.8</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles		84.3	     265.7</p>
<p> Available seat miles		  150.4	     423.4</p>
<p>					    Year-to-date</p>
<p> Load factor - percent		  57.1		68.8</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles	   1,534.4	   2,624.3</p>
<p> Available seat miles		2,689.1	   3,812.7</p>
<p>(Revenue passenger and available seat miles in 000,000s)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company noted that Dec load factor improved by almost eight points over Nov 1996 level.</p>
</text>
